{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00123",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.61,
      "end_seconds": 7.61,
      "duration_seconds": 7.0,
      "text": "Hi, you know, doctor. Long queue outside, but here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.26,
      "end_seconds": 12.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Right on time. Sit, please. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 17.68,
      "end_seconds": 22.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.28,
      "text": "Doctor, I'm just here to help with the details."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.85,
      "end_seconds": 26.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Please do. Extra information is always welcome."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.62,
      "end_seconds": 46.73,
      "duration_seconds": 19.11,
      "text": "Um, so... pain in my left wrist after a fall. That's why I came. It's the not knowing that gets to me. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.24,
      "end_seconds": 53.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "What about swelling, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.72,
      "end_seconds": 66.67,
      "duration_seconds": 11.95,
      "text": "Yeah, I've had that since Friday. So, you know, about swelling, mild, really. It settles a little with ice."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.61,
      "end_seconds": 70.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Any sign of pain in the shoulder?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.33,
      "end_seconds": 78.35,
      "duration_seconds": 7.02,
      "text": "No, you know, I haven't had any pain in the shoulder."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.84,
      "end_seconds": 84.15,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "Okay, so. Have you noticed loss of consciousness, deformity or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.9,
      "end_seconds": 90.66,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "I mean, no, no loss of consciousness, deformity or numbness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.41,
      "end_seconds": 96.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.01,
      "end_seconds": 101.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Right, nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.69,
      "end_seconds": 104.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.38,
      "end_seconds": 108.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Um, no, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.7,
      "end_seconds": 122.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Tell me what you take day to day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 122.81,
      "end_seconds": 133.42,
      "duration_seconds": 10.61,
      "text": "He is on alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week, I give it to him. He takes diclofenac, 50 milligrams, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.35,
      "end_seconds": 151.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.35,
      "end_seconds": 163.68,
      "duration_seconds": 10.33,
      "text": "I don't drink at all. I share a flat with two friends. Mostly home-cooked food, rice and vegetables."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.25,
      "end_seconds": 181.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.18,
      "end_seconds": 185.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "My father had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.84,
      "end_seconds": 190.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.3,
      "end_seconds": 203.18,
      "duration_seconds": 11.88,
      "text": "I mean, I've had thin bones for nearly five years now. Oh, I've had arthritis in my knees for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.77,
      "end_seconds": 217.88,
      "duration_seconds": 14.11,
      "text": "I see. Alright, thin bones, that matches what I have here. What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.62,
      "end_seconds": 222.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Oh, no, nothing I'm aware of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.86,
      "end_seconds": 226.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.55,
      "end_seconds": 234.35,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8,
      "text": "Almost there..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.0,
      "end_seconds": 258.73,
      "duration_seconds": 12.73,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 85, height 179 centimetres, respiratory rate 18, SpO2 99 percent on room air, weight 63 kilos, temperature 36.9, blood pressure 119 over 73."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.48,
      "end_seconds": 264.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "I'd like to examine you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.99,
      "end_seconds": 268.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Stay still while I have a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.97,
      "end_seconds": 282.12,
      "duration_seconds": 6.15,
      "text": "There's swelling and tenderness at the base of the thumb side of the wrist."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.62,
      "end_seconds": 285.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Let me press here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.06,
      "end_seconds": 305.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Fingers have good colour and the pulses are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.68,
      "end_seconds": 325.92,
      "duration_seconds": 17.24,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit up. Okay, so my impression is this: It fits best with a wrist sprain, but a small fracture is possible. I think an X-ray of the wrist makes sense here, for wrist injury."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.15,
      "end_seconds": 329.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.03,
      "end_seconds": 340.63,
      "duration_seconds": 10.6,
      "text": "For this, paracetamol, 650 milligrams, three times a day, for five days. You take it by mouth. That's for wrist pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.79,
      "end_seconds": 345.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Uh, fine, I'll start it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.93,
      "end_seconds": 363.19,
      "duration_seconds": 17.26,
      "text": "I'd like you to wear a splint until the X-ray result is confirmed and keep the hand raised. I think the orthopaedic clinic should see you too. I'd like to see you again after the X-ray. Okay, I think we're finished. Is everything clear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.03,
      "end_seconds": 367.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "No questions. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 368.73,
      "end_seconds": 370.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Mind how you go."
    }
  ]
}